{"source_filename": "/raid/home/ruchaa/projects/Curator/tutorials/multimodal_pretraining_curation/source/datasheet-nvidia-bluefield-2-dpu.pdf", "pages": [{"page_number": 1, "status": "Layout extraction successful", "content": [{"extraction_id": 0, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Page-header", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.0513314791403287, "ymin": 0.032, "xmax": 0.15414917825537297, "ymax": 0.0484}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "DATASHEET"}}, {"extraction_id": 1, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Title", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.0513314791403287, "ymin": 0.157, "xmax": 0.4440596713021492, "ymax": 0.1867}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "NVIDIA BLUEFIELD-2 DPU"}}, {"extraction_id": 2, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Text", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.05039393173198483, "ymin": 0.1906, "xmax": 0.4419762326169405, "ymax": 0.2125}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "Data Center Infrastructure on a Chip"}}, {"extraction_id": 3, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Text", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.05039393173198483, "ymin": 0.275, "xmax": 0.6271939317319849, "ymax": 0.4008}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "The NVIDIA\u00ae BlueField\u00ae-2 data processing unit (DPU) is the world\u2019s first data center infrastructure-on-a-chip optimized for traditional enterprises\u2019 modern cloud workloads and high performance computing. It delivers a broad set of accelerated software-defined networking, storage, security, and management services with the ability to offload, accelerate and isolate data center infrastructure. With its 200Gb/s Ethernet or InfiniBand connectivity, the BlueField-2 DPU enables organizations to transform their IT infrastructures into state-of-the-art data centers that are accelerated, fully programmable, and armed with \u201czero trust\u201d security to prevent data breaches and cyber attacks."}}, {"extraction_id": 4, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Text", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.05039393173198483, "ymin": 0.4047, "xmax": 0.6150058154235146, "ymax": 0.4961}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "By combining the industry-leading NVIDIA ConnectX\u00ae-6 Dx network adapter with an array of Arm\u00ae cores and infrastructure-specific offloads, BlueField-2 offers purpose-built, hardware-acceleration engines with full software programmability. Sitting at the edge of every server, BlueField-2 empowers agile, secured and high-performance cloud and artificial intelligence (AI) workloads, all while reducing the total cost of ownership and increasing data center efficiency. "}}, {"extraction_id": 5, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Text", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.04831049304677623, "ymin": 0.5016, "xmax": 0.6169850821744627, "ymax": 0.5648}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "The NVIDIA DOCATM software framework enables developers to rapidly create applications and services for the BlueField-2 DPU. NVIDIA DOCA makes it easy to leverage DPU hardware accelerators, providing breakthrough data center performance, efficiency and security. "}}, {"extraction_id": 6, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Section-header", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.052373198482932995, "ymin": 0.5766, "xmax": 0.5589613147914033, "ymax": 0.5992}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "Key Software-Defined, Hardware-Accelerated Applications"}}, {"extraction_id": 7, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Section-header", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6678209860935524, "ymin": 0.2945, "xmax": 0.7798058154235145, "ymax": 0.3117}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "KEY FEATURES"}}, {"extraction_id": 8, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Section-header", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6678209860935524, "ymin": 0.3133, "xmax": 0.7339701643489255, "ymax": 0.3281}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "Security"}}, {"extraction_id": 9, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6617790139064476, "ymin": 0.332, "xmax": 0.8326209860935525, "ymax": 0.3445}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> Hardened isolation layer"}}, {"extraction_id": 10, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6637582806573956, "ymin": 0.3477, "xmax": 0.8204328697850822, "ymax": 0.3594}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> Hardware root of trust"}}, {"extraction_id": 11, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6637582806573956, "ymin": 0.3602, "xmax": 0.8885613147914032, "ymax": 0.3852}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> IPsec/TLS and AES-XTS encryption acceleration"}}, {"extraction_id": 12, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6637582806573956, "ymin": 0.3875, "xmax": 0.8743939317319849, "ymax": 0.4125}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> Connection tracking for stateful firewall and IDS/IPS"}}, {"extraction_id": 13, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6658417193426043, "ymin": 0.4141, "xmax": 0.8519969658659924, "ymax": 0.4398}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> Regular expression (RegEx) matching processor"}}, {"extraction_id": 14, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "Section-header", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6658417193426043, "ymin": 0.4484, "xmax": 0.7279281921618205, "ymax": 0.4609}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "Storage"}}, {"extraction_id": 15, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6658417193426043, "ymin": 0.4656, "xmax": 0.850955246523388, "ymax": 0.4781}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> NVIDIA GPUDirect\u00ae Storage"}}, {"extraction_id": 16, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6658417193426043, "ymin": 0.4836, "xmax": 0.9049163084702908, "ymax": 0.5062}}, "data": {"type": "textual", "content": "> Elastic block storage enabled by BlueField SNAP storage virtualization"}}, {"extraction_id": 17, "metadata": {"source_page": 1, "type": "List-item", "bbox": {"xmin": 0.6678209860935524, "ymin": 0.5102, "xmax": 0.8855403286978508, "ymax": 0.532